description:
Solves #5284 

httpUrl allow single slash (http:/example.com) and no slash (http:example.com) 

example :
{
"parsedUser": {
"website": "http:example.com"
}
}

{
"parsedUser": {
"website": "https:/[www.google.com]
}
}

Add strict protocol:// check before new URL() for httpUrl()

